      "text": "* TanStack Query: Server-owned document records and repository listings.\n* Upload Manager: Transfer queue, concurrency, cancellation, retries, and\nprogress.\n* Small external store: Reactive snapshots for active upload items.\n* React local state: Dialog state, selection, filters, and UI interactions.\n* IndexedDB (optional): Upload session metadata for resumable transfers.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "* TanStack Query: Server-owned document records and repository listings.\n* Upload Manager: Transfer queue, concurrency, cancellation, retries, and progress.\n* Small external store: Reactive snapshots for active upload items.\n* React local state: Dialog state, selection, filters, and UI interactions.\n* IndexedDB (optional): Upload session metadata for resumable transfers.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
