      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- 500MB PDF should not be treated as small image\n- Native browser is simple but had browser dependent, can use PDF.js library,\nserver generated images, or support download only (poor UX experiences)\n\nPDF Viewer\n    |\n    v\nViewport Observer\n    |\n    v\nVisible Page Scheduler\n    |\n    +---- Current Page\n    |\n    +---- Previous Page\n    |\n    +---- Next Page\n    |\n    v\nCanvas Rendering",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- 500MB PDF should not be treated as small image\n- Native browser is simple but had browser dependent, can use PDF.js library, server generated images, or support download only (poor UX experiences)\n\nPDF Viewer\n    |\n    v\nViewport Observer\n    |\n    v\nVisible Page Scheduler\n    |\n    +---- Current Page\n    |\n    +---- Previous Page\n    |\n    +---- Next Page\n    |\n    v\nCanvas Rendering",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
