      "seed": 560697989,
      "version": 7,
      "versionNonce": 191452843,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791574078837,
      "created": 1791574062816,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What HTML/CSS can support\n* Native file selection.\n* Multiple-file selection.\n* Basic browser form submission.\n* Native validation for required inputs.\n* Basic accessible controls.\n* Responsive layout.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What HTML/CSS can support\n* Native file selection.\n* Multiple-file selection.\n* Basic browser form submission.\n* Native validation for required inputs.\n* Basic accessible controls.\n* Responsive layout.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "H3nlSJWrJccwPaqyeFBrh",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 516.8086814404146,
      "y": 5759.653206926305,
      "width": 622.49951171875,
      "height": 250,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1A",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1956978757,
      "version": 49,
      "versionNonce": 2060719365,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791574083552,
      "created": 1791574079883,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\nWhat requires JavaScript or additional server-driven navigation?\n* Drag-and-drop processing.\n* Per-file progress.\n* Dynamic concurrency limits.\n* File-level cancellation.\n* Fine-grained retries.\n* Client-side upload queues.\n* Live processing events.\n* Interactive preview state.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\nWhat requires JavaScript or additional server-driven navigation?\n* Drag-and-drop processing.\n* Per-file progress.\n* Dynamic concurrency limits.\n* File-level cancellation.\n* Fine-grained retries.\n* Client-side upload queues.\n* Live processing events.\n* Interactive preview state.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
